[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3709402444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114449#issuecomment-3709402444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114449","id":3709402444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dGP1M","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T08:27:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T08:27:03Z","body":"> This should probably exist in general--maybe someone wants a custom control and needs to explicitly define its accessibility behavior--but for now I just wanted to make sure the concept works. Happy to refactor to a separate role property in another PR if needed.\r\n\r\nRole can be changed by implementing `NOTIFICATION_ACCESSIBILITY_UPDATE` handler in the custom control, so not sure if it's necessary. If you are setting custom role, you'll likely want to set a bunch of other related values as well, so it will be overridden anyway. And adding all of the accessibility related values as properties are not an option for performance reasons.\r\n\r\nBut I guess adding a single property of a new class type which exposes bunch of stuff might be OK (similar to the `Label` allowing to configure its appearance with `LabelSettings`).\r\n\r\n> I added an accessible_region flag because it felt least invasive.\r\n\r\nMight be better to do it in the `Container` class instead, it seems more suitable than adding it to generic control (adding new properties to the higher superclass can also affect performance), and all of the use cases are containers.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3709402444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807627336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114449#issuecomment-3807627336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114449","id":3807627336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i88hI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T21:28:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T21:28:39Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807627336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743918727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114449#issuecomment-4743918727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114449","id":4743918727,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGsJ0hw","user":{"login":"PeterDrake","id":889193,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4OTE5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/889193?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake","html_url":"https://github.com/PeterDrake","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeterDrake/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T16:11:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:11:54Z","body":"I've got a use case that isn't a Container:\r\n\r\nI have a Control that has as children the hexes in a hex grid. The hexes have specific positions. Any Container would rearrange them.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743918727/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743979011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114449#issuecomment-4743979011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114449","id":4743979011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGsNgAw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T16:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:19:18Z","body":"> I have a Control that has as children the hexes in a hex grid. The hexes have specific positions. Any Container would rearrange them.\r\n\r\nCurrently, there's no convenient way to do it from the UI, but you can override role of any control to act as region by attaching a script with the following code:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\r\n\tif what == NOTIFICATION_ACCESSIBILITY_UPDATE:\r\n\t\tAccessibilityServer.update_set_role(get_accessibility_element(), AccessibilityServer.ROLE_REGION)\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743979011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]